('v0-by-vercel', 'v0 by Vercel', 'https://v0.dev', 'v0.dev', 'code', 'freemium', '1M+', 'UI components, React, prototypes', 'Generates React/Tailwind UI components from text descriptions. Export directly to Next.js.', ARRAY['Best UI component generator — React + Tailwind output is production-ready', 'Direct export to Next.js projects in one click', '200 free credits/month — enough for regular prototyping'], ARRAY['Focused only on frontend UI — no backend logic generation', 'Generated code can be verbose and needs cleanup for complex components']),
