('windsurf', 'Windsurf', 'https://codeium.com/windsurf', 'codeium.com', 'code', 'freemium', '1M+', 'Free AI IDE, multi-file edits, agentic coding', 'Free AI-powered IDE by Codeium. Agentic coding that writes and runs code across multiple files simultaneously.', ARRAY['Free tier far more generous than Cursor — unlimited code completions', 'Flows mode writes code across multiple files and runs commands automatically', 'Based on VS Code — zero learning curve for existing developers'], ARRAY['Newer product — occasional bugs in agentic multi-file editing mode', 'Smaller community and fewer tutorials than Cursor or GitHub Copilot']),
('cursor', 'Cursor', 'https://cursor.sh', 'cursor.sh', 'code', 'freemium', '500K+', 'AI IDE, code refactoring', 'VS Code-based IDE with built-in AI. Edit entire files with plain-text instructions.', ARRAY['Best multi-file understanding — reads and edits entire codebase with context', 'Composer mode handles large refactors across dozens of files at once', 'Works with any language, framework or project structure'], ARRAY['$20/month for Pro after 2-week trial', 'Resource-intensive — can slow down on older or low-RAM machines']),
