('surferseo', 'SurferSEO', 'https://surferseo.com', 'surferseo.com', 'marketing', 'paid', '150K+', 'On-page SEO, content scoring', 'Real-time AI content optimization for top Google rankings. Grade your article vs top results as you write.', ARRAY['Real-time content score vs actual top 10 Google results as you write', 'Keyword density and NLP term suggestions backed by SERP data', 'Integrates with Google Docs and WordPress for in-place scoring'], ARRAY['Grading tool only — does not replace broader SEO strategy', 'Starts at $79/month']),
